1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,978
Every chart is made of these.

2
00:00:02,347 --> 00:00:03,707
Here's how to read a candle.

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:10,717
Each candle shows four prices. Where it opened, where it closed, the highest point and the lowest point.

4
00:00:11,065 --> 00:00:14,369
The thick part is the body, and the thin lines are the wicks.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,661
A green candle closed higher than it opened.

6
00:00:18,069 --> 00:00:19,479
A red one closed lower.

7
00:00:19,979 --> 00:00:26,634
Read together, they tell a story. This one says buyers pushed price up, but sellers pushed it most of the way back.

8
00:00:26,973 --> 00:00:30,531
A long upper wick like that is a sign of rejection from above.

9
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:33,798
Practise reading candles at memestreet.net.

